   "title": "The loop wall Γ² = ½",
   "statement": "Γ = (z − 1)/(z + 1) = tanh h, h = ½ ln z. Γ² > ½ exactly when z² − 6z + 1 > 0, i.e. z > 3 + 2√2 = 5.828427 for z > 1.",
